- You said you asked the question,

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.070
you didn't finish the sentence.

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:45.300
We said, what's a surprising

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.520
item that has revolutionized
your everyday life,

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.433
maybe it's a special tool, a gadget,

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:51.123
something around the house,

00:00:51.123 --> 00:00:53.740
work, school, you know, just
trying to jog people's thoughts

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.900
because we put these
prompts out there, y'all,

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:00.301
